---
source: tests/cli_root.rs
expression: out
---
Generate the autocompletion script for qam for the specified shell

Usage: qam completion [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

Commands:
  bash        Generate the autocompletion script for bash
  fish        Generate the autocompletion script for fish
  powershell  Generate the autocompletion script for powershell
  zsh         Generate the autocompletion script for zsh
  help        Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --config <path>  Path to config file (default: $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/camsnap/config.yaml)
  -h, --help           Print help
